    87	- **Chat** — the user drives step by step; the manager reports back and waits for explicit direction at each transition.
    88	
    89	After the mode is set, ask via AskUserQuestion: "Would you like to customize any other settings (evaluation policy, discussion policy, iteration caps, models, git workflow)?" If yes, follow [`orchestration/SKILL.md § Step 1`](../orchestration/SKILL.md#step-1--workflow-configuration) rows 1-2 to walk through each section. If no, apply defaults as-is.
    90	
